0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-neutral max-w-none card p-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-600","children":"Personal finance guide"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mt-2","children":"Investment Planning Guide for Indian Beginners"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-lg text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Learn how to set goals, choose investment types, understand risk, and use calculators before investing."}],[["$","section","Start with goals, not products",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"Start with goals, not products"}],[["$","p","A good investment plan begins with the purpose of the money. Emergency savings, a house down payment, child education, retirement, and wealth building all need different time horizons and risk levels.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"A good investment plan begins with the purpose of the money. Emergency savings, a house down payment, child education, retirement, and wealth building all need different time horizons and risk levels."}],["$","p","Short-term money should usually prioritize safety and liquidity. Long-term money can tolerate more volatility if the goal is far away and you invest consistently.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Short-term money should usually prioritize safety and liquidity. Long-term money can tolerate more volatility if the goal is far away and you invest consistently."}]]]}],["$","section","Understand return, risk, and inflation",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"Understand return, risk, and inflation"}],[["$","p","Projected returns are estimates. Mutual funds, equity, gold, and other market-linked products can move up or down. Fixed-income products may feel safer, but inflation can reduce the real value of future money.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Projected returns are estimates. Mutual funds, equity, gold, and other market-linked products can move up or down. Fixed-income products may feel safer, but inflation can reduce the real value of future money."}],["$","p","Use a calculator to test conservative and optimistic assumptions. A 10-year plan should not depend on only one return number.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Use a calculator to test conservative and optimistic assumptions. A 10-year plan should not depend on only one return number."}]]]}],["$","section","Build a simple investing sequence",{"className":"mt-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-4","children":"Build a simple investing sequence"}],[["$","p","Before investing aggressively, create an emergency fund, buy adequate insurance, clear expensive debt, and then invest monthly for goals.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"Before investing aggressively, create an emergency fund, buy adequate insurance, clear expensive debt, and then invest monthly for goals."}],["$","p","For many Indian households, a basic sequence is emergency fund, term insurance if dependents exist, health insurance, tax planning, then SIP or goal-based investing.",{"className":"text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed mb-4","children":"For many Indian households, a basic sequence is emergency fund, term insurance if dependents exist, health insurance, tax planning, then SIP or goal-based investing."}]]]}]],"$L2","$L3"]}],null,"$L4"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"Ax3wWi7V9jZ9YxrzlbMEm"}
